        728.9461669921875,
        198.5760955810547
      ],
      "text": "Although there was a risk of selection bias, the characteristics of the two groups were similar. Patients with poor compliance were not included in the analysis of treatment outcomes. Downgraded by one level.  a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
