      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        197.97610473632812,
        619.2479248046875,
        207.5760955810547
      ],
      "text": "There was no clinical disease. The outcome reported was new radiographic findings suggesting possible active disease. No data compared with 6H. Downgraded by one level. b",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
